["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Recommendation Engine for Commodity Traders — Anekha Sokhal, Moshi RecSys MORSE Fulbright Scholarship ICLR Vision Language Model\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-22-latentspace-这家创业公司说自己不是新彭博-而是交易员的推荐系统/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c5deeb7411e2beff-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"L\"><span class=\"dur\">26:40</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Latent Space</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1022</span></div>\n<h2>這家創業公司說自己不是新彭博，而是交易員的推薦系統</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">創始人把公司定位為彭博、Claude和Netflix的結合體：價值不在給交易員更多數據，而在於像Netflix一樣主動推送他們自己想不到該看的二階關聯信號。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI創業</span><span class=\"tag\">大宗商品交易</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The New Apex Predator: CrowdStrike CEO George Kurtz on Adversaries Armed With AI Agents pyramid of pain breakout time ablated models digital twin distillation\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-22-nopriors-ai抹平攻击门槛-脚本小子也能用上国家级黑客的本事/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ad8f4d231b5e5ea8-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"N\"><span class=\"dur\">45:27</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">No Priors</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1022</span></div>\n<h2>AI抹平攻擊門檻：腳本小子也能用上國家級黑客的本事</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">開源大模型裝在家用電腦上就能造勒索軟件，入侵後平均29分鐘、最快27秒就能在系統裡橫向移動。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">網絡安全</span><span class=\"tag\">開源模型</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"How Leveraged ETFs Really Work (Marco Sammon &amp; Chris Murray) | #432 convexity bonus volatility drag break-even return swap expected log wealth\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-22-rationalreminder-3倍杠杆etf跑赢正股-标的股票得先涨170/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/0e52c937f0d183da-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:41:18</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Rational Reminder</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1022</span></div>\n<h2>3倍槓桿ETF跑贏正股，標的股票得先漲170%</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">槓桿ETF每天只盯日收益、不盯年化倍數：日波動5%的標的，3倍產品要漲170%才能反超正股本身——門檻隨波動率指數級跳升。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">槓桿ETF</span><span class=\"tag\">波動率損耗</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Bhaskar Sunkara Thinks the Market Has a Place Under Socialism market socialism soft budget constraint benchmark wage DSA Rawlsian liberalism labor-managed firm\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-22-oddlots-激进版社会主义-土地全部公有-但房租仍由市场决定/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dbb9160e6d589beb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">53:22</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Odd Lots</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1022</span></div>\n<h2>激進版社會主義：土地全部公有，但房租仍由市場決定</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">他主張，社會主義不必靠配給：把土地和住房全部收歸公有後，仍可以保留按市場定價的租金和搬遷自由，用價格而不是配給來分配空間。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">市場社會主義</span><span class=\"tag\">工人所有制</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"The dramatic race to discover Insulin Ebers papyrus ligate islets intersecretion theory\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-22-throughline-胰岛素救命的秘方-源自一个失败医生失眠夜写下的25个词/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/4970x4970+0+0/resize/3000/quality/66/format/jpg/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Ffd%2F78%2Fc52487db40188bbe5c7b3c988848%2F9d3ebf18-8ca2-4f49-b2a8-c589b344ae0c.jpeg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">37:08</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Throughline</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1022</span></div>\n<h2>胰島素救命的秘方，源自一個失敗醫生失眠夜寫下的25個詞</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">班廷本是四個月等不到一個病人的失敗醫生，一次失眠把講義和論文拼成25個詞，又瞞著同事搶先在垂死男孩身上做人體實驗，才在倫理真空裡搶出了胰島素。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">醫學史</span><span class=\"tag\">胰島素</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The charity that is also a time machine donor-advised fund (DAF) Schedule B chimera\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-22-complexsys-美国的捐赠基金其实是个时间机器-减税现在拿-捐钱以后再说/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/2b98a243f0a884fd-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">27:00</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Complex Systems</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1022</span></div>\n<h2>美國的捐贈基金其實是個時間機器：減稅現在拿，捐錢以後再說</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">這是一套合法的「慈善時間機器」：把錢存進去立刻減稅，捐給誰、何時捐可以往後拖很多年——Anthropic員工未來的鉅額捐款很可能就走這條路。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">慈善</span><span class=\"tag\">稅務</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Origins of Constantinople Tetrarchy Solidus Milion Notitia Hippodrome\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-22-ancients-罗马城早被废弃-君士坦丁堡只是把迁都做到了极致/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/83ea79d083d093bd-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">58:56</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">The Ancients</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1022</span></div>\n<h2>羅馬城早被廢棄，君士坦丁堡只是把遷都做到了極致</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">戴克裡先以來，米蘭、尼科米底亞、特里爾早已分走羅馬的權力和宮廷；君士坦丁只是把這套遷都慣例做大、做永久，並冠上自己的名字。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">拜占庭帝國</span><span class=\"tag\">羅馬帝國</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"The Myths vs Reality of Mummification natron mummia Fayum portraits unrolling party\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-22-historyhit-木乃伊制作不是为了保存遗体-而是要把死者变成神/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/eb07692a6c393b9b-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"D\"><span class=\"dur\">44:22</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">History Hit</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1022</span></div>\n<h2>木乃伊製作不是為了保存遺體，而是要把死者變成神</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">策展人坎貝爾·普萊斯說，裹屍、塗樹脂、畫金邊這些工序，目標是把屍體改造成神像，而非留住死者生前的容貌。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">古埃及</span><span class=\"tag\">木乃伊</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"從2億到40億，接班人如何重塑潔麗雅？｜欽文對話石晶 特勞特理論\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-22-wangqinwen-洁丽雅接班人放弃百亿目标-规模做到又能怎么样/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><div class=\"fallback\">王</div><span class=\"dur\">36:01</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">王欽文</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1022</span></div>\n<h2>潔麗雅接班人放棄百億目標：規模做到又能怎麼樣</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">三年前他喊出三年破百億的目標，如今卻說規模做到頭也沒意義，他要的是一個能活一百年、持續健康增長的品牌。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">家族企業</span><span class=\"tag\">二代接班</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Arvind Krishna &amp; Nikesh Arora: Quantum Threat, Open vs Frontier AI, AI Cyber Warfare &amp; SaaS Collapse QBI (Quantum Benchmarking Initiative) logical qubit post-quantum cryptography ZDR (zero data retention) open weight model\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-21-allin-加密硬盘现在被偷-五年后也可能被量子计算机破解/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/2252b98cbb7fdf85-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">40:00</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">All-In</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1021</span></div>\n<h2>加密硬盤現在被偷，五年後也可能被量子計算機破解</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">IBM和Palo Alto Networks的CEO說，量子計算機預計2030年前後就能破解今天的加密算法，而後量子密碼學方案早已現成，只是企業一直懶得換。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">量子計算</span><span class=\"tag\">密碼學</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"716. King Arthur: The Truth Behind the Legend (Part 4) Historia Britonum dux bellorum Annales Cambriae Mirabilia Britanniae Y Gododdin cataphract\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-21-restishistory-亚瑟之名只流行于六七世纪-这是他存在的最强证据/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/72c546eadef77e70-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:06:14</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">The Rest Is History</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1021</span></div>\n<h2>亞瑟之名只流行於六七世紀，這是他存在的最強證據</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">現存證據沒有一條能單獨證明亞瑟真實存在，但「亞瑟」作為羅馬人名只在不列顛貴族間流行過六七世紀這一小段時間，這個空窗至今無人能解釋。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">中世紀史</span><span class=\"tag\">史源考據</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"406. Norman Conquest: The First Crusade (Part 6) Varangian Guard Gesta Francorum liege man\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-21-empirehist-拜占庭皇帝求援换来十字军-却也换来博希蒙德的个人造神运动/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/6dcfd4bf69c91d0f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"E\"><span class=\"dur\">47:11</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Empire 世界史</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1021</span></div>\n<h2>拜占庭皇帝求援換來十字軍，卻也換來博希蒙德的個人造神運動</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">阿萊克修斯向西方求援引發了第一次十字軍東征，但真正借勢上位的是假死脫身、靠暢銷書包裝自己的諾曼人博希蒙德，拜占庭的名譽卻成了這場交易的代價。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">十字軍東征</span><span class=\"tag\">拜占庭帝國</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"At The Money: Can Dividend Investing Give You Yield AND Growth? yield trap free cash flow payout ratio net share issuance\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-21-mastersinbiz-股息不是收益率游戏-是识别哪家公司真能把现金还给你/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/f5dd15b785a2d85d-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"M\"><span class=\"dur\">23:30</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Masters in Business</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1021</span></div>\n<h2>股息不是收益率遊戲，是識別哪家公司真能把現金還給你</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">股息是現金，騙不了人；作者用自己在金融危機前以51美元賣出花旗的真實交易，說明高股息率常常是價格暴跌的假象，而非公司變好的信號。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">股息投資</span><span class=\"tag\">價值投資</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Cure to Founder Burnout Isn&#x27;t Rest | 6 Solo Founders swallow the frog chief of staff\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-21-solofounders-创始人倦怠的解药不是休息-而是重新找到动力/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/18d01623f9e39d48-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">22:41</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">單人創始人</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1021</span></div>\n<h2>創始人倦怠的解藥不是休息，而是重新找到動力</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">在Lindy熬了兩年多後，Flo以為自己需要半年假期才能恢復，但真正讓他走出倦怠的，是重新找到動力的那一刻，精力幾乎立刻就回來了。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">創始人倦怠</span><span class=\"tag\">獨自創業</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"AI lab staff: Has your project been overtaken by events? 8 strategic updates | Rob Wiblin RSI (recursive self-improvement) CoT monitoring Overton window eval awareness mech interp model organism\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-21-eightythousand-ai员工能拖慢失控进程-但这份议价权正在快速清零/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d87b66f6770249f5-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"8\"><span class=\"dur\">14:27</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">80,000 Hours</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1021</span></div>\n<h2>AI員工能拖慢失控進程，但這份議價權正在快速清零</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">技術員工能靠罷工式不配合為對齊研究拖出時間，但這種槓桿只在公司還離不開他們時成立——一旦模型自動化了他們的工作，這份權力就會歸零，所以能用就得現在用。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI安全</span><span class=\"tag\">遞歸自我改進</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Unearthed! in October 2026, Part 2 borrow pit maquette clinker-built\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-21-stuffmissed-中国壁画两千年不褪色-秘密是血液而非颜料/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/88586eb98e196b1a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">39:46</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Stuff You Missed in History Class</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1021</span></div>\n<h2>中國壁畫兩千年不褪色，秘密是血液而非顏料</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">左江花山岩畫兩千年保持鮮紅，科學分析發現顏料用石灰漿混血液作粘合劑，部分血液來自產後女性，可能帶有母系社會的儀式意味。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">考古</span><span class=\"tag\">沉船</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Missing Infrastructure for AI Agents: Documents | Reducto’s Adit Abraham VLM IDP harness recall\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-21-a16z-大模型处理长文档最容易犯的错-是悄悄漏掉信息/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">38:17</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1021</span></div>\n<h2>大模型處理長文檔最容易犯的錯，是悄悄漏掉信息</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">權威基準測試發現，頂尖大模型抽取長文檔時精確率很高，但會不動聲色地漏掉信息，這種錯誤在生產環境裡幾乎無法被發現。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">文檔處理</span><span class=\"tag\">AI agent</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"James Robinson on What It Looks Like When a State is Failing extractive institutions inclusive institutions creative destruction monopsony critical juncture\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-21-oddlots-诺奖得主断言-中国经济迟早要为政治集权买单/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dbb9160e6d589beb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">37:50</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Odd Lots</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1021</span></div>\n<h2>諾獎得主斷言：中國經濟遲早要為政治集權買單</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">他認為中國增長靠的是經濟從汲取性轉向包容性制度，但政治權力從未被制衡——權力導致腐敗、絕對權力導致絕對腐敗，這決定了增長終將脫軌，只是時間問題。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">制度經濟學</span><span class=\"tag\">拉美政治</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Broomology (BROOMS) with Cate O’Connell-Richards besom broomcorn johnny flying ointment broom squire Malleus Maleficarum\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-21-ologies-女巫飞天传说的真实来源-致幻药膏涂在扫帚柄上使用/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/6714d8dbd3a57d1f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">1:21:00</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Ologies</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1021</span></div>\n<h2>女巫飛天傳說的真實來源：致幻藥膏塗在掃帚柄上使用</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">所謂女巫騎掃帚飛天，脫胎自她們把含致幻生物鹼的藥膏塗抹在掃帚柄上、經粘膜吸收產生的飛行幻覺。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">民俗史</span><span class=\"tag\">手工藝</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"AI for the Fortune 2000: How Tenex Builds an AI-Native SDLC — Alex Lieberman &amp; CJ Hess MetaHarness FDE (forward deployed engineer) RBAC AMP Kill My SaaS\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-21-latentspace-多数企业用上了ai聊天-但智能体真正投产的不到5/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/a9a3ee5d13ee0cdf-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"L\"><span class=\"dur\">43:33</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Latent Space</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1021</span></div>\n<h2>多數企業用上了AI聊天，但智能體真正投產的不到5%</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">企業給員工裝上Claude和Codex很容易，90%已經做了；但把智能體真正部署進生產、幹非工程的活，只有5%做到——這中間的落差才是這期的核心數據。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">企業AI落地</span><span class=\"tag\">按產出付薪</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"155. 和科沃斯錢程聊，父與子、企二代接班的樣本與肌理、機器人，和我內心的追尋 physical AI FSD repetition\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-21-zhangxiaojun-29岁当上科沃斯ceo-他说那是愚昧之巅不是人生巅峰/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/655ca401e97f9e11-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">1:59:51</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1021</span></div>\n<h2>29歲當上科沃斯CEO,他說那是愚昧之巔不是人生巔峰</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">他接任CEO時以為到達人生巔峰，後來才明白那是一次史詩級錯判：戰略方向全對，卻因為不懂公司怎麼做決策，兩三年都沒把自己和組織的神經接上。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">企二代接班</span><span class=\"tag\">出海</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"#887: Q&amp;A with Tim — The 4-Hour Workweek in a World of AI, Rebuilding Personal Agency, The 4-Hour Body After 40, and More DEAL framework Oryx red teaming accelerated TMS vagal nerve stimulation Gymnastic Strength Training (GST)\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-20-timferriss-ai不会省时间-只会把垃圾工作做得更快/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/4859313b1789a4e8-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:19:06</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Tim Ferriss</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1020</span></div>\n<h2>AI不會省時間，只會把垃圾工作做得更快</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">沒有先定義和砍掉該做的事，AI只是加速器：它不會創造閒暇，只會把瑣碎、無關緊要的任務放大成更多工作。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">個人效率</span><span class=\"tag\">AI</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Programmable Data Center — Evan Conrad, SF Compute physical settlement cash settlement basis risk order book backplane InfiniBand fabric\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-20-latentspace-英伟达造不出算力期货市场-因为做了就得放弃自己的推理生意/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/74ca452fc18a3198-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"L\"><span class=\"dur\">36:43</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Latent Space</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1020</span></div>\n<h2>英偉達造不出算力期貨市場：因為做了就得放棄自己的推理生意</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">所有手握算力供給的玩家都有自己的生意要保護，只有徹底放棄推理和雲業務、只做中立撮合的人，才能讓這個價格被所有人信任。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">算力交易</span><span class=\"tag\">物理結算</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"James Marriott on the End of Reading Reading Revolution Republic of Letters ethnolinguistic fractionalization post-literate\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-20-goodfight-识字真正训练的不是知识-而是把情绪逐出说理的能力/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c75b9a8ba0dff85c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">The Good Fight</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1020</span></div>\n<h2>識字真正訓練的不是知識，而是把情緒逐出說理的能力</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">馬里奧特認為，識字真正的作用是把魅力、情緒等非理性說服手段逐出公共說理；讀寫衰退，意味著靠人格和情緒煽動的政治正捲土重來。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">閱讀衰退</span><span class=\"tag\">識字與民主</span>\n</div></div></a>"]